@startuml
title Delete Word Image Sequence (/api/admin/words/{id}/image)
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Admin
boundary "Vocabulary UI" as VocabularyPage
control "VocabularyController\n(FE Dashboard)" as DashboardController
entity "UpdateWordImageRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as ImageRequestDto
entity "WordDetailResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as ImageResponseDto
control "AdminWordsController\n(BE API)" as ApiController
control "WordAdminService" as WordService
entity "Word" as WordEntity
control "WordAdminRepository" as WordRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
note over VocabularyPage, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Dashboard route is POST /vocabulary/{id}/image/delete.
Dashboard VocaNovaApiClient calls PUT /api/admin/words/{id}/image with image_url = null.
API uses UpdateWordImageRequest and returns WordDetailResponse.
Delete image clears the word image_url; no storage delete call was found.
end note
Admin -> VocabularyPage: Click Delete image
VocabularyPage -> DashboardController: POST /vocabulary/{id}/image/delete
DashboardController -> ImageRequestDto: VocaNovaApiClient.UpdateImageUrlAsync(wordId, null)\nCreate request data(image_url = null)
ImageRequestDto -> ApiController: PUT /api/admin/words/{id}/imageUpdateWordImageRequest
ApiController -> ApiController: Check admin authorization
ApiController -> ApiController: Validate UpdateWordImageRequest
alt Request validation fails
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 400 error
DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show error message
else Request validation success
ApiController -> WordService: UpdateImageUrlAsync(wordId, null)
WordService -> WordService: Normalize image URL
WordService -> WordRepository: SetImageUrlAsync(wordId, null)
WordRepository -> DbContext: Find word
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT words
MySQL --> DbContext: Word row or null
DbContext -> WordEntity: Materialize Word?
WordEntity --> DbContext: Word or null
DbContext --> WordRepository: Result
alt Word not found
WordRepository --> WordService: null
WordService --> ApiController: NotFound result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 404 error
DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show error message
else Word found
WordRepository -> WordEntity: Clear ImageUrl
WordEntity --> WordRepository: Word updated
WordRepository -> DbContext: Track word image_url
DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE words
MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
DbContext --> WordRepository: Save result
WordRepository --> WordService: Updated word detail
WordService --> ApiController: Return updated word
ApiController -> ImageResponseDto: Create response data(WordDetailResponse)
ImageResponseDto --> DashboardController: HTTP 200 OK\nWordDetailResponse
DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show image removed feedback
end
end
@enduml
